 LOGS                                                                                                                   
   Move                                                                                                                 
     k  up            up                                                                                                
     j  down          down                                                                                              
     pgup  ctrl+b     page up                                                                                           
     pgdown  ctrl+d   page down                                                                                         
     g  home          top                                                                                               
     G  end           bottom (on logs: back to the live tail)                                                           
     >                next ERROR line                                                                                   
     <                previous ERROR line                                                                               
   Time and stream                                                                                                      
     ctrl+l           follow on/off (in a head: back to the default window, following)                                  
     space            pause / resume (keeps buffering)                                                                  
     P                previous instance of the restarted containers (why it crashed), again for the current logs        
     t                next time window                                                                                  
     T                pick a time window                                                                                
     1  &             window 15m                                                                                        
     2  é             window 30m                                                                                        
     3  "             window 40m                                                                                        
     4  '             window 45m                                                                                        
     5  (             window 1h                                                                                         
     6  -             window 1d                                                                                         
     7  è             window 2d                                                                                         
     0  à             tail (last lines)                                                                                 
     9  ç             head (first lines of each container; does not follow)                                             
   Filter                                                                                                               
     /  ctrl+f        filter as you type                                                                                
     x                filter (hide) or highlight (keep all)                                                             
     ctrl+r           regex on/off                                                                                      
     ctrl+a           stack another filter (AND), in the prompt                                                         
     X                context lines around matches: 0, 1, 3, 5                                                          
     n                next match                                                                                        
     N                previous match                                                                                    
     l                level picker                                                                                      
     e                errors only                                                                                       
     w                warnings and errors                                                                               
     a                all levels                                                                                        
   Inspect                                                                                                              
     enter            open / zoom / apply                                                                               
     v                trace view: every line with this line's trace_id, on all pods, with time deltas (esc back)        
     tab              pod scope: all, then each pod                                                                     
     S                select pods and containers (fullscreen)                                                           
     A                all containers (sidecars and init) or application containers only                                 
   Display                                                                                                              
     o                newest or oldest first                                                                            
     c                hide the next column (time, level, thread, class), then show them again                           
     ctrl+t           time format: local, UTC, relative (never hides it)                                                
     I                pod id: short, full, hidden                                                                       
     C                columns: time, pod, level, thread, class                                                          
     z                focus layout: hide pod, thread and class                                                          
     R                reset the display (columns, time format, pan, wrap), keep the filters                             
     W                wrap lines                                                                                        
     left             pan left (wrap off)                                                                               
     right            pan right (wrap off)                                                                              
     H                pan half a screen left                                                                            
     L                pan half a screen right                                                                           
     F                fullscreen                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
 GLOBAL                                                                                                                 
     ?  f1            help for this screen                                                                              
     f2  ctrl+k       key bar: compact, full, hidden                                                                    
     esc              back, close, exit fullscreen, clear the last filter                                               
     ctrl+e           switch environment                                                                                
     q  ctrl+c        quit                                                                                              
                                                                                                                        
 IN THE FILTER PROMPT                                                                                                   
     ctrl+r           regex on/off                                                                                      
     ctrl+x           filter or highlight                                                                               
     !                invert (as first character; \! for a literal !)                                                   
     ctrl+a           stack another filter (AND)                                                                        
     enter / esc      keep / cancel the edit                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
 sort name   HELP   keys follow keymap in ui.yaml                                                                       
 j/k scroll  / search  esc close                                                                                        